<p>Abbas tujhe ahle wafa yaad karenge</p>

<p>Aashor ki wo raat wo sannate ka aalam<br />
Fitrat ki qamoshi me farishto&rsquo;n ka wo maatam<br />
Soya hua ran me asadullah ka zaigham<br />
Aur khoon me dooba hua islaam ka parcham</p>

<p>Dekhi na gayi bacho&rsquo;n ki jab tashnadahani<br />
Aankho&rsquo;n me khatakne lagi moujo&rsquo;n ki rawaani<br />
Paani ke lie apna lahu kar diya paani<br />
Bachpan pa sakina ke fida kardi jawaani</p>

<p>Qabze me thi talwaar ke qabze me khudaai<br />
Do haath chali thi ke taraai nazar aayi<br />
Bhai ki wegha door se dekha kiye bhai<br />
Yu&rsquo;n shaane wafa toone wafadaar dikhaayi</p>

<p>Dunya se gaya shaan wafaa&rsquo;o ki dikha kar<br />
Paani na piya phenk diya muh se lagakar<br />
Ghode se gira khaak pa baazu ko katakar<br />
Soya bhi to soyi hui millat ko jaga kar</p>

<p>Ae Fatima Zahra ke qamar nayyare taabaa&rsquo;n<br />
Baazue Hussain ibne ali naasere eemaa&rsquo;n<br />
Qaaliq ki qasam kar gaya islam pa ehsaa&rsquo;n<br />
Ae mashke sakina ke muhaafiz tere qurbaa&rsquo;n</p>

<p>Naakaam hui dushmano&rsquo;n ki koshishe&rsquo;n paiham<br />
Girne na diya khaak pa islam ka parcham<br />
Jab tak rahi jaa&rsquo;n jism me seene me raha dam<br />
Rethi pa tahalta raha islam ka zaigham</p>

<p>Kazim koi karta hai to karne do bahana<br />
Goonjega fizaao me wafaa&rsquo;o ka taraana<br />
Har rang me dhal jaaega ye gham ka fasana<br />
Fitrat to na badlegi badal jaaye zamana</p>

